{
  "$comment": "Shared test vectors for the B1 submission-content rules (PRD B1.3 check formats and B1.5). Each case gives a learner's submission (online text and uploaded files) and the parts a reader must find. Pure data: no code. 'status' is 'derived' when the rules are decided by the guide (PR #61, 2026-11-11 and 2026-11-13) but this concrete example and its expected result were derived by the contract owner and still need review, and 'unverified-until-lab' when the expected result depends on how Moodle delivers editor HTML and must be checked on Moodle 4.5 and 5.3 before it is relied on. Behaviour that B1.5 lists as 'Not defined in v1' is not covered by any case. 'readme_cases' has fixtures for the B1.3 readme_sections rules: 'files' is what the repository holds (the README is only README.md at the root), 'check' is the Check cell, and a result is 'pass', 'fail' with the names of the missing sections, or 'invalid' with the unknown check name. 'covers' lists the B1.5 rules whose result the case shows; rules 8 (which check reads which part) and 9 (guidance for task text) cannot be shown in these part-level results and are never listed. All URLs use example.org.",
  "version": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "all-labels",
      "title": "All three labels in plain online text",
      "status": "derived",
      "covers": [
        "B1.5-1",
        "B1.5-2",
        "B1.5-3",
        "B1.3-word_count"
      ],
      "input": {
        "onlinetext": "Repository: https://example.org/alice/demo-assistant\nDemo: https://example.org/alice/demo\nReport: I built a small assistant. It worked after I fixed the prompt.",
        "onlinetext_format": "plain",
        "files": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "repository": {
          "value": "https://example.org/alice/demo-assistant"
        },
        "demo": {
          "value": "https://example.org/alice/demo"
        },
        "report": {
          "value": "I built a small assistant. It worked after I fixed the prompt.",
          "source": "onlinetext",
          "words": 12
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "labels-in-html",
      "title": "Labels in editor HTML (expected result unverified until the lab check)",
      "status": "unverified-until-lab",
      "covers": [
        "B1.5-5",
        "B1.5-1",
        "B1.5-3",
        "B1.3-word_count"
      ],
      "input": {
        "onlinetext": "<p>Repository: https://example.org/alice/demo-assistant</p><p>Demo: https://example.org/alice/demo</p><p>Report: I built a small assistant.<br>It worked after I fixed the prompt.</p>",
        "onlinetext_format": "html",
        "files": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "repository": {
          "value": "https://example.org/alice/demo-assistant"
        },
        "demo": {
          "value": "https://example.org/alice/demo"
        },
        "report": {
          "value": "I built a small assistant.\nIt worked after I fixed the prompt.",
          "source": "onlinetext",
          "words": 12
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "missing-demo",
      "title": "No Demo label: the check that reads it is an error",
      "status": "derived",
      "covers": [
        "B1.5-7",
        "B1.3-word_count"
      ],
      "input": {
        "onlinetext": "Repository: https://example.org/bob/demo-assistant\nReport: Short note.",
        "onlinetext_format": "plain",
        "files": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "repository": {
          "value": "https://example.org/bob/demo-assistant"
        },
        "demo": {
          "error": "field_missing"
        },
        "report": {
          "value": "Short note.",
          "source": "onlinetext",
          "words": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "report-as-file",
      "title": "No Report section: report.md is the report and is counted as it is",
      "status": "derived",
      "covers": [
        "B1.5-4",
        "B1.3-word_count"
      ],
      "input": {
        "onlinetext": "Repository: https://example.org/carol/demo-assistant\nDemo: https://example.org/carol/demo",
        "onlinetext_format": "plain",
        "files": [
          {
            "name": "report.md",
            "text": "# Reflection\n\nI built an assistant and it answered badly at first."
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "repository": {
          "value": "https://example.org/carol/demo-assistant"
        },
        "demo": {
          "value": "https://example.org/carol/demo"
        },
        "report": {
          "value": "# Reflection\n\nI built an assistant and it answered badly at first.",
          "source": "report.md",
          "words": 12
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "report-contains-demo-label",
      "title": "A line that starts with Demo: after Report: is part of the report",
      "status": "derived",
      "covers": [
        "B1.5-3",
        "B1.5-7",
        "B1.3-word_count"
      ],
      "input": {
        "onlinetext": "Repository: https://example.org/dave/demo-assistant\nDemo: https://example.org/dave/demo\nReport: The next line starts with the word Demo, and it is part of this report.\nDemo: https://example.org/dave/other",
        "onlinetext_format": "plain",
        "files": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "repository": {
          "value": "https://example.org/dave/demo-assistant"
        },
        "demo": {
          "value": "https://example.org/dave/demo"
        },
        "report": {
          "value": "The next line starts with the word Demo, and it is part of this report.\nDemo: https://example.org/dave/other",
          "source": "onlinetext",
          "words": 17
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "repeated-label",
      "title": "A label that appears twice before the report is an error, not first-wins",
      "status": "derived",
      "covers": [
        "B1.5-7",
        "B1.3-word_count"
      ],
      "input": {
        "onlinetext": "Repository: https://example.org/frank/demo-assistant\nDemo: https://example.org/frank/one\nDemo: https://example.org/frank/two\nReport: Two demo links.",
        "onlinetext_format": "plain",
        "files": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "repository": {
          "value": "https://example.org/frank/demo-assistant"
        },
        "demo": {
          "error": "field_repeated"
        },
        "report": {
          "value": "Two demo links.",
          "source": "onlinetext",
          "words": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
